        "identity": {
          "graphId": "contracts-root"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Contracts\n\nThe contracts that use the current vocabulary, in three groups.\n\n**Graph.** What a graph, a port and an edge class are.\n\n**Bridges.** How a graph uses what another offers: grants, exposure, the editor, the node on the canvas, the renderer, and the graphs that organise others.\n\n**Docs.** How a document graph is written, how gestures are owned, and what an author can set.\n\nThe older contracts in this folder (manifest, legend, dictionary, the skill documents and others) are kept for reference and are not listed here.\n\nThis graph is a collection. Each tile is a portal it contains, and what a tile shows is read from the graph behind it."
        },
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1791502752029,
